=== SUMMARY ===
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
data sources : SearchPageViewModel binds the shared S7 SearchRepository.globalSearch via searchPageSourceOf() (web
               `useGlobalSearch`); the live SearchInput drives planSearch (the web `enabled` guard) -> cache-then-
               network feed -> groupHits (the web `groupedHits` memo) -> UiState. No HTTP in the view.
si/units     : no field on the search read is unit-bearing (titles, urls, scores, timestamps), so there is no SI
               conversion at any layer — consistent with the shared SearchModels doc. The per-type limit (25) is a
               count, not a unit.
a11y/theme   : shared EmptyState/Button/Badge/GlassPanel supply semantics; each facet chip exposes the web
               aria-pressed as TalkBack `selected`; each result row is a >=56dp Button role; the grouped-results
               region carries the localized "Results" description; icons are decorative (contentDescription=null);
               all color/typography from MaterialTheme (A2 tokens) for dynamic-color + dark theme; Compose-native (no
               webview).
nav          : Destinations 'search' -> /search (pre-existing, Destinations.kt:180) wired to SearchRoute() via
               PageHosts.register; deep link auto-registered by TeslaSyncNavHost; each row -> teslasync://app + hit.url.
